22:10.000 --> 22:13.000
Nach cùbairean a thearbadh leis,

22:13.000 --> 22:18.000
Thoirt gnìomh nan arm gu clì.

22:20.000 --> 22:24.000
Seo dùthaich a’ mhulaid

22:24.000 --> 22:27.000
Tha gach duine fo ghruaim;

22:27.000 --> 22:29.000
